<Layout
  title="Sri Krishna Janmashtami Celebration | Icon School of Excellence"
  description="Experience the joy of Sri Krishna Janmashtami at Icon School of Excellence, with cultural performances and festivities in Bangalore"
  keywords="Janmashtami celebrations Bangalore, school cultural events, Krishna festivities, Icon School traditions"
  robots="index, follow"
  canonical="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com/events/sri-krishna-janmashtami"
>
